<title>GERMANY: MOTOR RACING-WORLD GT CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-WORLD GT CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NURBURGRING, Germany 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in</p>
<p>the fourth round of the World GT Championship on Sunday:</p>
<p>Race distance 147 laps (667.674 kms)1. Bernd Schneider/Klaus</p>
<p>Ludwig (Germany) Mercedes four hours zero mins 11.517 secs</p>
<p>(average speed 167.29 kph)</p>
<p>2. Alessandro Nannini (Italy)/Marcel Tiemann (Germany) one</p>
